  "title": "Alpha Tau to Participate in May Investor Conferences",
  "summary": "JERUSALEM, May 18, 2026 — Alpha Tau Medical Ltd. (“Alpha Tau”, or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: DRTS, DRTSW), the developer of the innovative alpha-radiation cancer therapy Alpha DaRT®, today announced that CFO Raphi Levy will participate in the following investor conferences in May 2026. Event: H.C. Wainwright 4th Annual BioConnect Investor Conference Format: Fireside Chat and […]",
